    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46134" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζειρά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a wide upper garment</i>, girded
